   397→* `frame`: frame widget already registered with [AddFrame](#libeditmodeaddframeframe-callback-default-)
   398→* `settings`: table containing [SettingObject](Types#settingobject) entries _(table, number indexed)_
   399→--]]
   400→function lib:AddFrameSettings(frame, settings)
   401→	if not lib.frameSelections[frame] then
   402→		error('frame must be registered')
   403→	end
   404→
   405→	lib.frameSettings[frame] = settings
   406→end
