   607→--[[ LibEditMode:RegisterCallback(_event, callback_) ![](https://img.shields.io/badge/function-blue)
   608→Register extra callbacks whenever an event within the Edit Mode triggers.
   609→
   610→* `event`: event name _(string)_
   611→* `callback`: function that will be triggered with the event _(function)_
   612→
   613→Possible events:
   614→
   615→* `enter`: triggered when the Edit Mode is entered
   616→* `exit`: triggered when the Edit Mode is exited
   617→* `layout`: triggered when the Edit Mode layout is changed (which also occurs at login)
   618→    * signature:
   619→        * `layoutName`: name of the layout
   620→        * `layoutIndex`: index of the layout
   621→* `create`: triggered when a Edit Mode layout has been created
   622→    * signature:
   623→        * `layoutName`: name of the new layout
   624→        * `layoutIndex`: index of the layout
   625→        * `sourceLayoutName`: name of the layout it was copied from, if it was copied
   626→* `rename`: triggered when a Edit Mode layout has been renamed
   627→    * signature:
   628→        * `oldLayoutName`: name of the layout that got renamed
   629→        * `newLayoutName`: new name of the layout
   630→        * `layoutIndex`: index of the layout
   631→* `delete`: triggered when a Edit Mode layout has been deleted
   632→    * signature:
   633→        * `layoutName`: name of the layout that got deleted
   634→
   635→Example:
   636→
   637→```lua
   638→LibEditMode:RegisterCallback('rename', function(oldLayoutName, newLayoutName, layoutIndex)
   639→    -- do something
   640→end)
   641→```
   642→--]]
   643→function lib:RegisterCallback(event, callback)
   644→	assert(event and type(event) == 'string', 'event must be a string')
   645→	assert(callback and type(callback) == 'function', 'callback must be a function')
   646→
   647→	if event == 'enter' then
   648→		table.insert(lib.anonCallbacksEnter, callback)
   649→	elseif event == 'exit' then
   650→		table.insert(lib.anonCallbacksExit, callback)
   651→	elseif event == 'layout' then
   652→		table.insert(lib.anonCallbacksLayout, callback)
   653→
   654→		-- if there's none, then onEditModeChanged will take care of it
   655→		if lib.activeLayout then
   656→			securecallfunction(callback, layoutNames[lib.activeLayout], lib.activeLayout)
   657→		end
   658→	elseif event == 'create' then
   659→		table.insert(lib.anonCallbacksCreate, callback)
   660→	elseif event == 'rename' then
   661→		table.insert(lib.anonCallbacksRename, callback)
   662→	elseif event == 'delete' then
   663→		table.insert(lib.anonCallbacksDelete, callback)
   664→	else
   665→		error('invalid callback event "' .. event .. '"')
   666→	end
   667→end
   668→
